      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਪਵਿਤਰ ਅਤੇ ਦੋਸ਼-ਰਹਿਤ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 6,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि पाक बिऐब हैं ॥",
