      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 6,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि सरबत्त्र भउनै ॥१११॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74657",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0006_line_0077",
      "lineIndex": 77,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਸਰਬੱਤ੍ਰ ਦੇਸੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k saraba'tr dhesai ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art in every country!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ!) ਤੂੰ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਦੇਸ਼ਾ ਵਿਚ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 6,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि सरबत्त्र देसै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74658",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0006_line_0078",
      "lineIndex": 78,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਸਰਬੱਤ੍ਰ ਭੇਸੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k saraba'tr bhesai ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art in every garb!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਭੇਸਾ ਵਿਚ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 6,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि सरबत्त्र भेसै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74659",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0006_line_0079",
      "lineIndex": 79,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਸਰਬੱਤ੍ਰ ਰਾਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k saraba'tr raajai ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art the King of all!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਸਭ ਥਾ ਰਾਜ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈਂ (ਬਿਰਾਜਮਾਨ ਹੈਂ)",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 6,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि सरबत्त्र राजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74660",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0006_line_0080",
      "lineIndex": 80,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਸਰਬੱਤ੍ਰ ਸਾਜੈ ॥੧੧੨॥",
